1
00:00:00,353 --> 00:00:01,508
Imagine someone

2
00:00:01,558 --> 00:00:03,715
hands you an envelope.

3
00:00:04,132 --> 00:00:06,049
Inside is one date.

4
00:00:06,099 --> 00:00:07,448
The day

5
00:00:07,498 --> 00:00:09,936
your life ends.

6
00:00:10,473 --> 00:00:11,464
Maybe you'd

7
00:00:11,514 --> 00:00:13,231
stop waiting.

8
00:00:13,281 --> 00:00:15,235
Say the things.

9
00:00:15,285 --> 00:00:16,957
Live every day

10
00:00:17,007 --> 00:00:18,399
on purpose.

11
00:00:18,909 --> 00:00:19,926
Or maybe…

12
00:00:19,976 --> 00:00:23,172
not knowing is what

13
00:00:23,222 --> 00:00:25,439
lets you breathe.

14
00:00:25,858 --> 00:00:26,512
One life

15
00:00:26,562 --> 00:00:27,791
counts its days.

16
00:00:27,841 --> 00:00:30,095
The other never

17
00:00:30,145 --> 00:00:31,647
counts at all.

18
00:00:32,022 --> 00:00:33,997
Neither is wrong.

19
00:00:34,047 --> 00:00:35,945
Both take courage.

20
00:00:38,035 --> 00:00:38,351
So…

21
00:00:38,401 --> 00:00:41,202
would you open it?

